                                "sense_id": "3920816e-1284-340f-9f70-8daed63ea7f0",
                                "text": "And Lancelot answer'd nothing, but he went, / And at the inrunning of a little brook / Sat by the river in a cove"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9c4036bb-01fb-46fe-9753-4d18f5fc8aab",
                                "sense_id": "3920816e-1284-340f-9f70-8daed63ea7f0",
                                "text": "On either side the woodland moved slowly back. The morning mist had not yet vanished, but floated against the trees in silver drifts, and veiled every inrunning of the shores with bright mystery."
